  "id": "730343b7-00a6-468a-ac45-c4d69152f4c1",
  "page_title": "Azure OpenAI Service Assistants API concepts",
  "page_description": "Learn about the concepts behind the Azure OpenAI Assistants API.",
  "page_date": "03/04/2024",
  "chunk_title": "Parameters",
  "chunk_content": "Parameters  The Assistants API has support for several parameters that let you customize the Assistants' output. The `tool_choice` parameter lets you force the Assistant to use a specified tool. You can also create messages with the `assistant` role to create custom conversation histories in Threads. `temperature`, `top_p`, `response_format` let you further tune responses. For more information, see the reference documentation.",
